442	     * case-insensitively with runs of whitespace collapsed to a single space (and
443	     * surrounding whitespace trimmed); the postcode is compared for exact equality (two
444	     * absent postcodes count as equal). Owners in the same household resolve to the same
445	     * {@link #computeHouseholdId() household identifier}.
446	     *
447	     * @param other the owner to compare against
448	     * @return {@code true} if both owners share a household
449	     */
450	    public boolean sameHouseholdAs(Owner other) {
